        "69046201": {
          "name": "Integrated - Girtablullu",
          "stage_num": 1,
          "monster_level": 70,
          "layer_buff": {
            "69014203": {
              "title": "",
              "desc": "· When an Agent's attack hits a Boss, the Boss gains 1 point of Dissonance. The same Agent can apply at most 1 point of Dissonance every 1s.\n· When a Boss accumulates 10 points of Dissonance, all Dissonance points are immediately removed and the Boss enters the Dissonant state. While in the Dissonant state, enemies take <color=#2BAD00>40% bonus Attribute Anomaly DMG</color> for s. Re-entering the Dissonant state resets the duration.\n· When an Agent successfully inflicts an Attribute Anomaly on a Boss, all Agents on the squad gain the Transmutation effect: <color=#2BAD00>DMG dealt increases by 15%</color> and Anomaly Proficiency <color=#2BAD00>increases by 20 points</color>. The Transmutation effect lasts 10s, and repeated triggers reset the duration."
            },
            "69014204": {
              "title": "",
              "desc": "· Each time you successfully parry an attack from Girtablullu's summoned minions and trigger <color=#FFAF2C>Active Conversion</color>, you gain <color=#FFAF2C>500 Performance Points</color>; successfully triggering <Term:2000004></Term> against Girtablullu's attacks grants <color=#FFAF2C>1000 Performance Points</color>, up to 3 times; if you successfully <color=#FFAF2C>break the Corruptive Barrier within 25s</color> of Girtablullu <color=#FFAF2C>first activating</color> <Term:2000001></Term>, you gain <color=#FFAF2C>1500 Performance Points</color>. A maximum of 5,000 Performance Points can be obtained."
            },
