              "title": "TBD",
              "desc": "· The Agent's Sharp DMG <color=#2BAD00>increases by 25%</color>, and DEF <color=#2BAD00>increases by 20%</color>.\n· After the Agent launches an <color=#FFFFFF>[EX Special Attack]</color> or <color=#FFFFFF>[Ultimate]</color>, attacks that hit enemies ignore <color=#2BAD00>20%</color> of their <color=#2EB6FF>Electric RES</color> for 20s; repeated triggers reset the duration."
            },
            "69014502": {
              "title": "TBD",
              "desc": "· If there are 2/3 Agents in the squad with <color=#FFFFFF>[Anomaly]</color> specialty, the whole squad's Anomaly Proficiency <color=#2BAD00>increases by 30/80</color> respectively, and Anomaly Buildup inflicted <color=#2BAD00>increases by 10%/30%</color> respectively.\n· After inflicting an <color=#FFFFFF>Attribute Anomaly</color> on an enemy, the enemy's DEF is <color=#2BAD00>reduced by 25%</color> for 10s. Repeated triggers reset the duration."
